.workongoing
# Image bytes live on R2, never in git (ACCESS.md). Local syncs sit untracked.
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
*.heic
*.dng
*.pdf
# the splits/ trees are symlinks named like images — keep them trackable
!splits/**
